{"ticker":"CONCOR","symbol":"CONCOR","instrumentId":3022395,"name":"Container Corp.","industry":"NSE-Transportation-Logistics","about":"Container Corporation of India Ltd. (CONCOR), is a premier public sector enterprise under the Ministry of Railways, specializing in multimodal logistics and containerized cargo transport across India. CONCOR operates a vast network of inland container depots (ICDs) and container freight stations (CFSs), providing end-to-end logistics solutions, including transportation by rail and road, handling, and warehousing. As the market leader in its segment, CONCOR plays a critical role in supporting India’s trade and export-import (EXIM) activities, driving efficiency and connectivity across the logistics chain, and contributing significantly to the country’s economic growth.","website":"www.concorindia.co.in","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:13:52.116Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":444,"changePct":1.6134569172674245,"week52High":534.75,"week52Low":410.15},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹33,816 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹9,109 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"342,728,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"300"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"290,101,818"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.78%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.61"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.05"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.2"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"7%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"27.7"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"32–56"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"19.46"},{"label":"Volume","value":"506,473"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,079,193"},{"label":"Master score","value":"45"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"42"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"35"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"71"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":